{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Nightmare Busters Rebirth",
    "steam_appid": 3237630,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237630/extras/d9a065bf01bb8be010229f2e2cd20705.avif?t=1747408568\" data-has-big width=800 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237630/extras/f8ada1befca200277ebb3772239ffe6f.avif?t=1747408568\" data-has-big width=800 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Nightmare Busters Rebirth</i> is a fast-paced run 'n gun game with stunning hand-drawn 2D visuals. Travel through the Kingdom of Dreams to defeat the nightmare menace and bring sweet dreams back to the children!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Kingdom of Dreams is in peril</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Tyrant, an evil creature, has assembled a nightmarish army to seize control of the kingdom. Luckily, Flynn and Floyd, two leprechaun brothers and skilled nightmare hunters armed with magical cards, are here to stop him!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One game, two eras</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the golden age of arcade games, <i>Nightmare Busters Rebirth</i> immerses players in a stunning world where the supernatural meets fast-paced action. Take control of Flynn and Floyd, the leprechaun brothers, as you explore diverse environments and put your reflexes to the test. Blending tight gameplay, explosive action, and hand-drawn graphics, this 2D run 'n gun is a thrill ride for adrenaline junkies!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A classic, lovingly remade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally developed in 1994 by Arcade Zone for the Super Nintendo,\u00a0the release of\u00a0<i>Nightmare Busters</i> was ultimately canceled. Now, in partnership with Pix\u2019n Love Games, Aurora Game Studio breathes new life into this extraordinary game. With <i>Nightmare Busters Rebirth</i>\u2014and under the guidance of some of the original creators\u2014you\u2019ll experience this intense adventure through a complete overhaul. The game now features enhanced visuals, refined animations, and a fully reorchestrated soundtrack while staying true to the essence of what made the original so special.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore diverse and magical environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle massive bosses that will put your skills to the test!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share the adventure in local co-op for two players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your character by choosing your secondary shot, three superpowers, and a passive ability!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modern gameplay: easy to learn, challenging to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay levels to chase the coveted S++ rank.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gorgeous, hand-drawn 2D graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic moments filled with thrills and emotions!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237630/extras/d9a065bf01bb8be010229f2e2cd20705.avif?t=1747408568\" data-has-big width=800 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237630/extras/f8ada1befca200277ebb3772239ffe6f.avif?t=1747408568\" data-has-big width=800 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Nightmare Busters Rebirth</i> is a fast-paced run 'n gun game with stunning hand-drawn 2D visuals. Travel through the Kingdom of Dreams to defeat the nightmare menace and bring sweet dreams back to the children!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Kingdom of Dreams is in peril</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Tyrant, an evil creature, has assembled a nightmarish army to seize control of the kingdom. Luckily, Flynn and Floyd, two leprechaun brothers and skilled nightmare hunters armed with magical cards, are here to stop him!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One game, two eras</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the golden age of arcade games, <i>Nightmare Busters Rebirth</i> immerses players in a stunning world where the supernatural meets fast-paced action. Take control of Flynn and Floyd, the leprechaun brothers, as you explore diverse environments and put your reflexes to the test. Blending tight gameplay, explosive action, and hand-drawn graphics, this 2D run 'n gun is a thrill ride for adrenaline junkies!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A classic, lovingly remade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally developed in 1994 by Arcade Zone for the Super Nintendo,\u00a0the release of\u00a0<i>Nightmare Busters</i> was ultimately canceled. Now, in partnership with Pix\u2019n Love Games, Aurora Game Studio breathes new life into this extraordinary game. With <i>Nightmare Busters Rebirth</i>\u2014and under the guidance of some of the original creators\u2014you\u2019ll experience this intense adventure through a complete overhaul. The game now features enhanced visuals, refined animations, and a fully reorchestrated soundtrack while staying true to the essence of what made the original so special.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore diverse and magical environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle massive bosses that will put your skills to the test!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share the adventure in local co-op for two players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your character by choosing your secondary shot, three superpowers, and a passive ability!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modern gameplay: easy to learn, challenging to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay levels to chase the coveted S++ rank.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gorgeous, hand-drawn 2D graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic moments filled with thrills and emotions!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Hunt down nightmares in the Kingdom of Dreams in this gorgeous, action-packed 2D run 'n gun, playable in local co-op for up to two players!",
